'' T23, RUN: an array of ustring is an ARRAY, not a fixed-length string. 'ubound( us )' and
'' 'lbound( us )' print, go through str( ), add and compare; and 'a( ) as ustring' is a
'' parameter. FixedStringElem listed TY_USTRING, so every ustring array was taken for a
'' 'ustring * N': the bound came out untyped and its 'print' vanished with the newline,
'' and the parameter was TKO0636. 'ustring * N' is TY_FIXUSTR. Output identical to
'' fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/ustring-array.bas -o tests/codegen/ustringarray.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/ustringarray.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/ustringarray.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: n= 2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: m=2!
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  3-1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  4
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: xyz
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: end
